# behavior: arguments to Rust standard-library callees take the shape their signature needs: owned bytes and a Rust Vec of bytes lend as a slice to from_utf8, an explicit as_slice() argument is kept, a bytes literal and an owned bytes local borrow as a slice, an owned Vec of bytes passes by value to String.from_utf8, and a str literal and an owned str local borrow into Path.new
